  "exercise_count": 15,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "问题1. 做一件大衣用料子3.14米，做一套西服用料子2.83米。做大衣和西服共用了多少米料子？",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0213#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了解这个题，需要把3.14和2.83加起来：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0213#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$3.14+2.83=3\\frac{14}{100}+2\\frac{83}{100}=5\\frac{97}{100}=5.97$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0213#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这个题也可以用另一种方法来解：把长度用米和厘米表示：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0213#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$3.14$米$+2.83$米$=3$米$14$厘米$+2$米$83$厘米$=5$米$97$厘米$=5.97$米。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0213#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "问题2. 一南瓜重6.4公斤，另一南瓜重5.28公斤。这两个南瓜共重多少？",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0213#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由于$6.4=6.40$，而$6.40+5.28=11.68$，所以两个南瓜共重11.68公斤。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0213#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "小数加法也和自然数加法一样，可以方便地写成“竖式”：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0213#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\phantom{+}3.14\\qquad\\phantom{+}6.40$ $\\underline{+\\ 2.83}\\qquad\\underline{+\\ 5.28}$ $\\phantom{+}5.97\\qquad11.68$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0213#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "两个小数相加，需要：1）使各加数的小数点后的位数相等；2）各加数小数点对齐；3）和自然数的加法一样作加法；4）相加以后，在和的对着加数小数点的位置上点上小数点。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0213#13",
        "p0214#1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
